<h1>Command-line tools, one tap</h1>
<p class="lead">Homebrew (macOS, Linux), Scoop and WinGet (Windows) packages for the tools of
<a href="https://github.com/GregoireF">GregoireF</a>.</p>

<pre>brew tap gregoiref/tap
scoop bucket add gregoiref https://github.com/GregoireF/homebrew-tap</pre>

<ul class="tools">
<% served.each do |tool, release| -%>
<li>
<a class="name" href="<%= h tool.name %>/"><%= h tool.name %></a>
<span class="badge<%= release.verified == "attestation" ? "" : " checksum" %>"><%= release.verified == "attestation" ? "SLSA provenance" : "SHA-256" %></span>
<div><%= h tool.desc %></div>
<div class="meta"><%= h release.version %><%= release.published ? " · #{h release.published[0, 10]}" : "" %> · <%= h tool.license %></div>
</li>
<% end -%>
</ul>
